<title>INDIA: Indian Apr-Sept steel output 10.66 mln tonnes.</title>
<headline>Indian Apr-Sept steel output 10.66 mln tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>India produced 10.66 million tonnes of finished steel between April and September, 13.3 percent more than during the same six-month period in 1995, the government said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>India consumed 10.375 million tonnes of steel during the same period, 9.3 percent higher than April-September 1995.</p>
<p>India's finished steel exports rose 15.5 percent to 455,000 tonnes while the country's imports fell 22 percent to 630,000 tonnes, the government said in a statement.</p>
<p>--New Delhi newsroom +91-11-301 2024</p>
</text>
